    """The confirmation_token of the approval this request replaces. Needed only when that approval was already approved and hasn't started yet; one still waiting for a decision is replaced automatically. Only where Layrcake runs approved actions itself (the result's approval block says execution: server); anywhere else it is refused. A dry run doesn't check it, so it refuses it: send it on the call itself."""

